<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4643] JdbcDatabaseMetadata.getIndexInfo() method not working</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4643</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;JdbcDatabaseMetadata.getIndexInfo()&lt;/tt&gt; method does not update metadata before creating result set. So if it&apos;s a first method invocation on this instance of &lt;tt&gt;JdbcDatabaseMetadata&lt;/tt&gt;, it fails with NPE. Need to create tests and add &lt;tt&gt;updateMetaData()&lt;/tt&gt; call in the beginning of the method.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13039684">IGNITE-4643</key>
            <summary>JdbcDatabaseMetadata.getIndexInfo() method not working</summary>
